<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Lab 17 — ${identity}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1f2933; }
    h1 { color: #5c4ee5; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: .2rem .6rem; border-radius: 1rem; background: #e6f4ea; color: #137333; font-size: .9rem; }
    code { background: #f1f3f5; padding: .1rem .3rem; border-radius: 4px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>${message}</h1>
  <p><span class="badge">${environment}</span></p>
  <p>Participant : <code>${identity}</code></p>
  <p>Chaîne : <code>git push</code> → GitHub Actions → <code>terraform plan</code> → <code>terraform apply</code> → Azure</p>
</body>
</html>
